{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアルバムの特典イベントだった\nクルージングがありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約、1年半ぶりくらいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にも1stアルバムの特典イベントで\nありましたが、いつもと違う形で\n皆さんとお会いするのがなんだか\n不思議な感じです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣り部で鍛えた\n船酔いもすることなく\n夜ご飯のバイキングもたくさん食べて\n同じテーブルになった皆さんとも\n仲良くクイズできました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜ご飯のテーブルでは、\n伊織、まいちゅん、蘭世、琴子と一緒で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズゲームのテーブルは\n万理華さんと琴子と一緒でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"船の外に出て、伊織とも写真撮ったり\nたのしかったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも来る東京が\n船の上から見渡すと\n全然違う風景にみえて不思議！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風に吹かれた～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は札幌に住んでる\n2つ下の従兄弟の高校最後の野球の試合だったみたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌支部予選の決勝で\n惜しくも負けてしまったみたいですが\nとてもいい試合でいい顔をしていたと\n聞きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな素敵な試合を最後にすることができて、本当によかったね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで頑張ってきたからね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が小学生の低学年の頃、\n札幌のおばあちゃん家のお庭で\nお兄ちゃんが新聞でつくったボールを\n従兄弟に投げて練習に付き合ったり、\nお兄ちゃんと素振りの練習を\n夏に北海道に帰った時にしていたことを\n思い出します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢中になれること\n頑張れることがあることって\n本当に素敵！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校を卒業して野球を続けるのかは\nまだ聞いていないけど、\n野球で培った精神の強さや\n人を思う大切な気持ちや\n感謝の心は忘れないで\nこれからも学生さん頑張ってね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の妹とその従兄弟は同い年だから、\n受験生できっと夏休みはないんだろうけど\n2人とも受験勉強が終わったら\nどこか連れていってあげよう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"従兄弟は北海道帰った時か\n東京遊びに来た時で\n妹はいつでもいいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうそう！\nその野球の試合が行われた球場に\nあのポスターが飾られていたみたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーーーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"従兄弟のお母さんが\nあったよー！！と送ってくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、普段やっているお仕事を\n北海道にいる従兄弟や親戚、祖父母にも\n見える形で活躍できていることは\nとても嬉しいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからももっともっと頑張るぞ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のお仕事もがんばるぞー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また報告できるものから\n報告していくね(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は楽しみなお仕事がいっぱい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/03/5763215/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}